# ─── Model artifacts (all generated output) ──────────────────────────────────
# The entire output directory is regenerated by the pipeline — nothing here
# needs to be version-controlled. This covers:
#   - output/merged_model/   (multi-GB merged weights)
#   - output/gguf/           (quantized GGUF + conversion artifacts)
#   - output/lora_adapter/   (adapter weights, tokenizer copies, checkpoints)
Model/model_qwen4_finetuning/output/

# Processed/tokenized dataset cache
Model/model_qwen4_finetuning/data/output/

# ─── Unsloth compiled cache (auto-generated trainer code) ────────────────────
**/unsloth_compiled_cache/

# ─── llama.cpp (vendored C++ dependency, large) ──────────────────────────────
Model/model_qwen4_finetuning/llama.cpp/

# ─── HuggingFace / model cache ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.cache/
*.cache/

# ─── Large binary files (catch-all) ──────────────────────────────────────────
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.bin
!requirements*.txt

# ─── Per-user config (loaded from gitignored files) ──────────────────────────
Model/inference/calendar_users.json

# ─── Node / frontend ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ─── IDE / editor ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
